WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.302 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Now, obviously,
you know you're up against

00:00:02.302 --> 00:00:03.636 line:92%
the legacy of the first film

00:00:03.636 --> 00:00:05.905 align:start size:94% position:6%
and you have to
figure out funny bits,

00:00:05.905 --> 00:00:07.340 line:92%
and you have to figure out

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:09.609 align:start size:94% position:6%
how to land
this political commentary

00:00:09.609 --> 00:00:12.012 align:start size:94% position:6%
in a way
that felt incredibly fresh

00:00:12.012 --> 00:00:15.181
But I will say, the part
that really blew me away,

00:00:15.181 --> 00:00:17.083 align:start size:94% position:6%
amongst everything else,
the relationship --

00:00:17.083 --> 00:00:19.419
The father-daughter relationship
in this film

00:00:19.419 --> 00:00:20.620 size:75% position:38% line:92%
is really beautiful.

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:22.222 line:92%
Did you know from the beginnin

00:00:22.222 --> 00:00:24.357 align:start size:94% position:6%
that that would have to be
the backbone of this,

00:00:24.357 --> 00:00:27.427 align:start size:94% position:6%
or was it something you foun
in the writing?

00:00:27.427 --> 00:00:29.195 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah, that was --

00:00:29.195 --> 00:00:31.131 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, we had a challenge
right.

00:00:31.131 --> 00:00:33.333 line:92%
We're making another "Borat.

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:36.803 align:start size:94% position:6%
And the first "Borat"
went down amazingly well.

00:00:36.803 --> 00:00:39.272 align:start size:94% position:6%
We thought nobody in the world
would want to see a movie

00:00:39.272 --> 00:00:44.344
about an anti-Semitic journalist
from Central Asia

00:00:44.344 --> 00:00:46.112 size:84% position:42% line:92%
that was a documentary.

00:00:46.112 --> 00:00:49.349
But then we're set with doin
this new one and bring it ou

00:00:49.349 --> 00:00:53.820
before the election, making sure
it's, you know, satirical.

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:55.588 align:start size:94% position:6%
Obviously, you've got
all these other challenges

00:00:55.588 --> 00:00:58.758 align:start size:94% position:6%
trying to get into
Trump's inner circle.

00:00:58.758 --> 00:01:03.129 align:start size:94% position:6%
But, yeah -- But fundamentally
me and the other writers

00:01:03.129 --> 00:01:05.265 line:92%
realized it's gonna be emotion

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:07.867 align:start size:94% position:6%
You've got to actually car
about the relationship

00:01:07.867 --> 00:01:09.502 line:92%
between Borat and his daughter

00:01:09.502 --> 00:01:13.706 align:start size:94% position:6%
So we looked at a bunch of
kind of, father-daughter movie

00:01:13.706 --> 00:01:15.208 line:92%
like "Fiddler on the Roof.

00:01:15.208 --> 00:01:16.176 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Not the Kazakh version,

00:01:16.176 --> 00:01:19.212 align:start size:94% position:6%
which is they just throw a Jew
off a building.

00:01:19.212 --> 00:01:22.248 align:start size:94% position:6%
But, you know, all these -
"Paper Moon."

00:01:22.248 --> 00:01:24.451 align:start size:94% position:6%
All these sort of
arranged-marriage movies.

00:01:24.451 --> 00:01:27.487 line:92%
'Cause you actually have t

00:01:27.487 --> 00:01:30.423 align:start size:94% position:6%
want these two characters
to be together.

00:01:30.423 --> 00:01:33.626
-So, there's -- I mean,
as thrilling as any scene

00:01:33.626 --> 00:01:34.694 line:92%
in an action movie last year

00:01:34.694 --> 00:01:40.333 align:start size:94% position:6%
was you dressing up
in a full Trump costume

00:01:40.333 --> 00:01:41.801 size:84% position:42% line:92%
and breaking into CPAC.

00:01:41.801 --> 00:01:44.204 align:start size:94% position:6%
Can you talk about
what you had to go through

00:01:44.204 --> 00:01:45.705 line:92%
to get into the building?

00:01:45.705 --> 00:01:49.175
-Yeah, well -- So, that da
was pretty much like this.

00:01:49.175 --> 00:01:53.913 align:start size:94% position:6%
I wake up at 2:00 in the
morning, drive to some motel

00:01:53.913 --> 00:01:55.715 line:92%
There's a full prosthetics team.

00:01:55.715 --> 00:02:02.288 align:start size:94% position:6%
They spent five hours
turning me into Donald Trump

00:02:02.288 --> 00:02:04.324 line:92%
And then, yeah, you know -

00:02:04.324 --> 00:02:09.562
We obviously have to get through
various layers of Secret Service

00:02:09.562 --> 00:02:13.633 size:84% position:42%
then hid in a bathroom
for another four hours.

00:02:13.633 --> 00:02:17.203 line:92%
And then I was concerned that --

00:02:17.203 --> 00:02:20.707 size:84% position:42%
I essentially got taken
by the Secret Service

00:02:20.707 --> 00:02:22.008 size:81% position:41% line:92%
after I did the scene.

00:02:22.008 --> 00:02:24.611 align:start size:94% position:6%
I had 15 --
15 kind of different

00:02:24.611 --> 00:02:26.713 align:start size:94% position:6%
law-enforcement people
around me.

00:02:26.713 --> 00:02:30.383
And I knew that I couldn't
let them know who I was,

00:02:30.383 --> 00:02:32.152 line:92%
because then word would get out.

00:02:32.152 --> 00:02:36.322 align:start size:94% position:6%
And if my name got out there
infiltrating CPAC,

00:02:36.322 --> 00:02:37.557 size:88% position:44% line:92%
the movie would be done.

00:02:37.557 --> 00:02:39.425 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, you know,
I had one of the cops --

00:02:39.425 --> 00:02:41.561 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know,
there's 15 guys around me.

00:02:41.561 --> 00:02:44.164 align:start size:94% position:6%
And there's a guy
with a big badge, and he goes,

00:02:44.164 --> 00:02:45.064 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"Give me your I.D."

00:02:45.064 --> 00:02:47.433 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I said,
"I'm not giving over my I.D.

00:02:47.433 --> 00:02:49.802 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't know
if you're law enforcement.

00:02:49.802 --> 00:02:50.737 line:92%
He was like, "Look at my badge!"

00:02:50.737 --> 00:02:53.873 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I go, "Well, I don't kno
if that's a real badge."

00:02:53.873 --> 00:02:56.009 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then one of the other guys
says,

00:02:56.009 --> 00:02:57.243 size:88% position:44% line:92%
"Just give me your I.D."

00:02:57.243 --> 00:02:58.912 line:92%
And I said, "It's in my shoe

00:02:58.912 --> 00:03:01.281 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do you want me
to take off my shoe?"

00:03:01.281 --> 00:03:03.349 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he's like,
"Oh, yeah, you're right."

00:03:03.349 --> 00:03:05.552 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then I carry on
for a few minutes.

00:03:05.552 --> 00:03:09.322
And then one of the other
Secret Service guys says,

00:03:09.322 --> 00:03:11.024 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"Where's his I.D.?"

00:03:11.024 --> 00:03:12.825 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he goes,
"Well, it's in his shoe."

00:03:12.825 --> 00:03:15.728 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know. And he goes, "So
what?! Get it out of the shoe!

00:03:15.728 --> 00:03:18.331 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then the Secret Service
take me into a separate room

00:03:18.331 --> 00:03:22.468 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I'd hired a bail lawye
for them --

00:03:22.468 --> 00:03:24.003 line:92%
in case they arrested me.

00:03:24.003 --> 00:03:26.739 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I'm in the room,
and they close this door.

00:03:26.739 --> 00:03:28.041 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I can hear
my bail lawyer going,

00:03:28.041 --> 00:03:31.411
"Let me in. I represent the --
My client is behind the door!"

00:03:31.411 --> 00:03:33.513 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I said --
They started questioning me.

00:03:33.513 --> 00:03:35.215 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I said,
"I'd seen all the movies."

00:03:35.215 --> 00:03:38.284 align:start size:94% position:6%
I go, "I refuse
to answer any questions

00:03:38.284 --> 00:03:40.353 line:92%
until my lawyer is present!"

00:03:40.353 --> 00:03:42.622 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I go, "And he's just
outside that door.

00:03:42.622 --> 00:03:44.324 size:84% position:42% line:92%
I insist he be let in!"

00:03:44.324 --> 00:03:45.658 align:start size:94% position:6%
They go,
"we're the Secret Service.

00:03:45.658 --> 00:03:49.395 align:start size:94% position:6%
It doesn't work like that.
You can answer the questions."

00:03:49.395 --> 00:03:52.065 align:start size:94% position:6%
So they basically decided
not to arrest me.

00:03:52.065 --> 00:03:54.601 align:start size:94% position:6%
They said,
"Get off the property."

00:03:54.601 --> 00:03:58.838
Then, what they didn't realize
was, about two minutes later

00:03:58.838 --> 00:04:01.708 line:92%
we had two other people also -

00:04:01.708 --> 00:04:04.410 line:92%
One was a Trump impersonator

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:06.646 size:81% position:41% line:92%
and one was a stuntman

00:04:06.646 --> 00:04:10.917 align:start size:94% position:6%
dressed also in
a prosthetic mask as Trump

00:04:10.917 --> 00:04:13.186 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, they say,
"You come back here,

00:04:13.186 --> 00:04:14.020 line:92%
you're going to be arrested.

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:18.725
Two minutes later, these two
guys come into the -- into CPAC,

00:04:18.725 --> 00:04:19.993 align:start size:94% position:6%
and they're
immediately arrested.

00:04:19.993 --> 00:04:23.029 align:start size:94% position:6%
And they, you know, are
surrounded by Secret Service

00:04:23.029 --> 00:04:25.965 align:start size:94% position:6%
One is like,
"Take that mask off your face!

00:04:25.965 --> 00:04:27.066 align:start size:94% position:6%
And the guy goes,
"This is my face!"

00:04:27.066 --> 00:04:30.136 align:start size:94% position:6%
The trump impersonator
had no idea what's going on.

00:04:30.136 --> 00:04:31.271 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then the stuntman --
They go,

00:04:31.271 --> 00:04:34.207
"We told you, if you come back
you're going to be arrested!

00:04:34.207 --> 00:04:38.011 align:start size:94% position:6%
After an hour with
a prosthetics makeup artist,

00:04:38.011 --> 00:04:40.446 align:start size:94% position:6%
they removed the mask
and realized it wasn't me.

00:04:40.446 --> 00:04:42.882 align:start size:94% position:6%
So it was a challenge.
-All right.

00:04:42.882 --> 00:04:45.418 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, again,
I know you've been through

00:04:45.418 --> 00:04:47.654 align:start size:94% position:6%
some of these
white-knuckle moments.

00:04:47.654 --> 00:04:50.456 align:start size:94% position:6%
Are you a little terrified
when you're in the room

00:04:50.456 --> 00:04:52.659 line:92%
with Secret Service like that?

00:04:52.659 --> 00:04:54.027 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-Yeah.

00:04:54.027 --> 00:04:55.361 line:92%
-Yes. I mean, you don't --

00:04:55.361 --> 00:04:58.965
You don't think anything violent
is going to happen to you,

00:04:58.965 --> 00:05:00.033 size:78% position:39% line:92%
although there was --

00:05:00.033 --> 00:05:04.037
There was one point when we were
preparing the Giuliani scene

00:05:04.037 --> 00:05:07.840 align:start size:94% position:6%
with somebody who had
Secret Service protection,

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:09.942 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I had to get trained
on what to do

00:05:09.942 --> 00:05:13.479 align:start size:94% position:6%
when the person's got
Secret Service protection.

00:05:13.479 --> 00:05:17.050 size:81% position:41%
I won't say who it is.
Shout, "Help, help."

00:05:17.050 --> 00:05:19.452 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, you know,
I was trained on what you do

00:05:19.452 --> 00:05:20.820 line:92%
Essentially, the first thing

00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:22.789 align:start size:94% position:6%
that a secret Service
person does,

00:05:22.789 --> 00:05:24.457 line:92%
is they jump on you in the room.

00:05:24.457 --> 00:05:26.926 align:start size:94% position:6%
So the advice was
lie on the floor

00:05:26.926 --> 00:05:28.895 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause they're gonna
jump on you.

00:05:28.895 --> 00:05:30.630 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's, you know --
They're big guys.

00:05:30.630 --> 00:05:33.766 size:81% position:41%
And they're trying to,
obviously, you know --

00:05:33.766 --> 00:05:37.870 align:start size:94% position:6%
to stop whoever is getting
you know, shot.

00:05:37.870 --> 00:05:40.473 align:start size:94% position:6%
So they don't know.
That's the first protocol.

00:05:40.473 --> 00:05:44.644
And so I -- We went through th
kind of training on what to do

00:05:44.644 --> 00:05:46.412 size:88% position:44% line:92%
In the end, we didn't --

00:05:46.412 --> 00:05:48.748 align:start size:94% position:6%
didn't go ahead
with that person,

00:05:48.748 --> 00:05:50.750 line:92%
and we ended up with Giuliani.

00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:52.719 line:92%
-Well, I can only say thank yo

00:05:52.719 --> 00:05:54.754 align:start size:94% position:6%
for continuing
to take these risks.

00:05:54.754 --> 00:05:57.056 align:start size:94% position:6%
And congratulations
on both films.

00:05:57.056 --> 00:05:57.890 line:92%
They were both wonderful.

00:05:57.890 --> 00:06:00.259 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it was really great
talking to you.

00:06:00.259 --> 00:06:03.463 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thank you, Seth. Thank you.
Thank you for having

00:06:03.463 --> 00:06:06.799 align:start size:94% position:6%
my least-funny character
on your show.

00:06:06.799 --> 00:06:08.901 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We're glad --
We're glad to finally --

00:06:08.901 --> 00:06:10.203 size:84% position:42% line:92%
He should get out more.

00:06:10.203 --> 00:06:11.270 line:92%
"Borat Subsequent Moviefilm"

00:06:11.270 --> 00:06:12.672 align:start size:94% position:6%
is streaming
on Amazon Prime Video.

00:06:12.672 --> 00:06:15.308
And "The Trial of the Chicago 7"
is streaming on Netflix.

00:06:15.308 --> 00:06:17.110 size:75% position:38% line:92%
We'll be right back.

